{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't hand over your basket.|Put it on the stand."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Basket in hand.|All stare."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same hands.|On the stand."},{"id":"s5","text":"Basket down.|She smiles."},{"id":"s6","text":"She shouted—"},{"id":"s7","text":"She scans on.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Bag packed.|Cashier beams."},{"id":"s9","text":"The stand does the work.|That's the rule."},{"id":"n1","text":"Basket on the stand.|Not in her hands."},{"id":"n2","text":"Step back.|Watch it work."},{"id":"n3","text":"Bagged and done.|No handover."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}